                "Reasi lithium occurs in bauxitic clay overlying Sirban limestone (500–1000 ppm Li).",
                "Other Indian prospects: Degana (Rajasthan) and Marlagalla-Allapatna pegmatites (Mandya, Karnataka).",
                "The South American 'Lithium Triangle' comprises Bolivia (Uyuni), Chile (Atacama), and Argentina.",
